    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "New style free card game Solitaire. It also known as Classic Solitaire.\r\nWe keep the game true to the spirit of the classic Solitaire. Funny and challenging card game that anyone can enjoy. \r\nSimple to start but hard to master.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2660 Single tap or drag&drop to move cards\r\n\u2660 So many beautiful themes\r\n\u2660 Daily challenges\r\n\u2660 Clean and user-friendly menus \r\n\u2660 Draw 1 card, draw 3 cards \r\n\u2660 Auto complete\r\n\u2660 Auto-save game\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free undo\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free hints\r\n\u2660 Left-handed supported\r\n\u2660 Tablet supported\r\n\u2660 More features to come!\r\n\u2660 100+ challenging achievements\r\n\r\nHave fun with playing Solitaire!",
    "descriptionHTML": "New style free card game Solitaire. It also known as Classic Solitaire.<br>We keep the game true to the spirit of the classic Solitaire. Funny and challenging card game that anyone can enjoy. <br>Simple to start but hard to master.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2660 Single tap or drag&amp;drop to move cards<br>\u2660 So many beautiful themes<br>\u2660 Daily challenges<br>\u2660 Clean and user-friendly menus <br>\u2660 Draw 1 card, draw 3 cards <br>\u2660 Auto complete<br>\u2660 Auto-save game<br>\u2660 Unlimited free undo<br>\u2660 Unlimited free hints<br>\u2660 Left-handed supported<br>\u2660 Tablet supported<br>\u2660 More features to come!<br>\u2660 100+ challenging achievements<br><br>Have fun with playing Solitaire!",
